  "title": "Lime Glazed Leg of Lamb",
  "description": "A refreshing alternative to the usual lemon, garlic, rosemary seasoning for lamb. This tangy lime and white wine sauce will be a sure hit. Lamb comes out juicy and flavorful. Baste is also good on other meats and poultry.",
